# U-SCRIPT V6.50 - U-PANEL - OBFUSCATED
# V6.20 FIX (25 Nov): the old wrapper extracted to mktemp (/tmp/tmp.XXXX) and
# deleted it after the extracted script exited - but the Panel server daemonizes
# (nohup) and keeps running, so every later job ran "sh <deleted file>" ->
# "No such file or directory" + [EXIT 127]. Now the payload lives at a STABLE
# path /tmp/U-Panel.sh that is NEVER deleted - the server U_PANEL_PATH and
# find_script() both resolve to it, so jobs keep working after the menu exits.
# V6.50: (1) Menu arrows REMOVED for real - the ">" on every menu card was a CSS
# ::after chevron (.grid2 a::after{content:">"}), not text, so text fixes never
# touched it - now display:none. Terminal menu arrow (01 ▸ Text) removed too.
# (2) Live TV cutting - player was in ultra-low-latency chasing mode
# (liveSync + chasing, tolerance 1s, 128KB stash) so ANY network jitter made it
# JUMP/cut. Now smooth mode: no chasing, 1MB stash - plays continuously.
# V6.49: /live/stream is a pure passthrough (no per-packet PAT/PMT rewrite).
